  subgraph WORKLOAD["Compromisable workload account — final profile"]
    App[Workload Lambda<br/>bounded IAM: own logs + intent intake]:::untrusted
    AppLogs[CloudWatch app/platform logs<br/>corroborative, forgeable/suppressible]:::untrusted
    WorkParser[Whitelisted metadata adapter]
    WorkTrail[Selected account-native CloudTrail]
    App --> AppLogs --> WorkParser
  end
  subgraph SECURITY["Independently controlled security account"]
    GatewayAPI[IAM workload-entry API] --> Gateway[Trusted expected-action gateway]
    Gateway --> Issuer[Scoped opaque-token issuer]
    Issuer --> Registry[(Encrypted disposable-token registry)]
    Gateway --> App
    App --> SaaSAPI[Bearer-protected synthetic SaaS API]
    SaaSAPI --> SaaS[Provider Lambda]
    Registry --> SaaS
    SaaS --> Outbox[(Durable provider-owned audit outbox)]
    Outbox --> Forwarder[Stream forwarder + original-ID replay]
    Forwarder --> ProviderQ[Independent provider queue + DLQ]
    Gateway --> Intake[IAM source-bound intake]
    App -->|untrusted intent| Intake
    Health[Operational health monitor<br/>availability ≠ completeness] --> Intake
    Intake --> MainQ[Evidence queue + DLQ]
    SecLogs[Selected access/platform logs] --> Parser[Whitelisted metadata adapter]
    Parser --> PlatformQ[Platform queue + DLQ]
    WorkParser -->|narrow cross-account append| PlatformQ
    SecTrail[Selected security-native CloudTrail] --> Native[(Retained versioned native-log bucket<br/>source trail/account restrictions)]
    WorkTrail --> Native
    Native --> TrailParser[Version-pinned CloudTrail metadata adapter]
    TrailParser --> TrailQ[AWS API queue + DLQ]
    ProviderQ & MainQ & PlatformQ & TrailQ --> Normalize[Source-bound normalizer<br/>idempotent archive-first persistence]
    Normalize --> Archive[(Protected KMS/Object Lock evidence<br/>raw valid records + receipts<br/>metadata-only rejection quarantine)]
    Normalize --> Index[(Evidence index / active cursors / health)]
    Index --> Sweep[Bounded deadline sweeper / IBER]
    Sweep --> Decisions[(Append-only decision revisions<br/>separate mutable current pointer)]
    Decisions --> Bus[Findings bus]
    Bus --> Dispatch[Deterministic execution deduplication]
    Dispatch --> SFN[Standard response workflow]:::gate
    SFN --> Broker[Encrypted callback-token broker]:::gate
    Broker --> Approval[(Approval coordination + retained decisions)]
    Operator[Authorized operator] --> OpsAPI[IAM operator API / CLI]:::gate
    OpsAPI --> Approval
    Approval -->|reviewed exact action callback| SFN
    SFN --> Responder[Leased responder + durable attempt history]
    Responder -->|current revision checked atomically| Registry
    Responder -->|separate revocation / integration probes| SaaSAPI
    Responder -->|approved recovery: old rejected, fresh succeeds| Issuer
    Responder --> Intake
    Investigator[Read-only investigator] --> Cases[Cases / private report API]
    Decisions & Index & Archive --> Report[Exact-version forensic exporter]
    Cases --> Report -->|private reports prefix| Archive
    FailureQ[Restricted async-failure queues<br/>reviewed redrive / replay; never purge] --> Operator
    Alarms[Queue/error/missing-sweep alarms + dashboard] --> Operator
  end
  note -.-> WORKLOAD
